Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.00,0:00:06.00,staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs60}翻译：挂件 kurako sigterm  时轴：澄空秋色  校对：小恐龙 小孝  压制：James
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:08.76,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 調子どうだい?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:10.68,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}どうだって晴れだい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.36,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}頑張っても 頑張んなくても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:17.27,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey どんな壁だって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:19.19,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}目の前にあれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.19,0:01:23.40,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}気づかない だって壁じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:31.61,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}どんな寂しさも 全部受け止めるからね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:33.71,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Wake Up!） ちょっと遊んだり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:35.96,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Hey World!） ちょっと悩んだり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:38.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ないものばっか数えないで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:39.84,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}手んなかそっと数えたら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.88,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） ほらね聞こえる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.88,0:01:44.01,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） ほらね感じる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.01,0:01:47.95,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Take One!） 君に伝えたくて ここにいるから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:50.26,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}We can do!! で You can ドゥ!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:52.64,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}世界ごと Love & peace
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:54.88,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}あれもこれもそれもどれも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.88,0:01:56.82,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}半分こ （にしよう）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:02:00.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}あらゆる世界が私たち変えても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:03.24,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}嬉しい楽しい美味しいだけは
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:05.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}忘れないでーね!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.20,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey world?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:10.20,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Say yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:12.25,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Good world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:08.76,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 心情怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:10.68,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}像晴天一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.36,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}努力也好 不努力也好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:17.27,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 无论什么墙壁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:19.19,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}在我的眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.19,0:01:23.40,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}也不在意它 也不会阻挡我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:31.61,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}无论怎样寂寞 全部欣然接受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:33.71,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Wake Up!） 再玩一小会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:35.96,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Hey World!） 稍有些烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:38.00,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}没有的东西不要去数了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:39.84,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只要数清手中的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.88,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） 就能听得见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.88,0:01:44.01,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） 就会感受到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.01,0:01:47.95,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Take One!） 我就在这里 想要对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:50.26,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}我们能做到!! 豆能做到!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:52.64,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}带给每个世界 Love & peace
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:54.88,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}这里 那里 这里 那里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.88,0:01:56.82,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一半（分给你）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:02:00.98,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}就算让世界 改变了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:03.24,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只有开心 欢乐和美味
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:05.74,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}请不要忘记!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.20,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey world?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:10.20,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Say yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:12.25,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Good world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:21:00.87,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}娘のドゥが
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.49,0:21:02.92,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}優しすぎる~!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:12.19,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい!　そろそろ　危機感!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.43,0:21:15.88,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}予測をつかない思考回路
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.16,0:21:18.44,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい!　たびたび　虚無感!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.44,0:21:21.93,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}私の手に負えない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:24.79,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんてこと…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.79,0:21:27.94,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}このところ魔界は平和です
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:30.76,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}だけどちょっと
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:32.67,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなのもいいのかなぁ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:33.82,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にこにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:35.11,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いっせーの
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:37.38,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いっこ　にこ　さんこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:38.11,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんだい?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:40.38,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}分けてあげるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:41.08,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}うんうん
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:44.33,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒でにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:46.54,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:47.50,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:49.60,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:50.51,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.51,0:21:52.50,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:55.13,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ちょいまちー!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.13,0:21:57.82,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなんじゃダメダメダメダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.82,0:21:59.68,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}流されちゃいそうだ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:02.68,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忙しいの　私
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:05.27,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}世·界·侵·略!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.27,0:22:08.31,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなはずじゃないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.31,0:22:09.80,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ダメダメダメダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:11.62,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}流されちゃダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:14.69,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}次から次ToDo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.69,0:22:17.11,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}お·め·め　うるうる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.11,0:22:20.11,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にこにこしちゃいそう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.74,0:22:23.38,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にっ!　にこにこ!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:21:00.87,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我的女儿豆豆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.49,0:21:02.92,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}太温柔了~!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:12.19,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好啦好啦! 快快 危机感!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.43,0:21:15.88,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}无法预测的思考回路
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.16,0:21:18.44,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好啦好啦! 偶尔 虚无感!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.44,0:21:21.93,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我两手都忙不过来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:24.79,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}怎么会这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.79,0:21:27.94,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}最近的魔界真和平
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:30.76,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不过有点觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:32.67,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也许这样也不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:33.82,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}微笑微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:35.11,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一二三
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:37.38,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}1个 2个 3个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:38.11,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:40.38,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}排排坐 分果果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:41.08,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:44.33,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:46.54,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:47.50,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:49.60,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:50.51,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.51,0:21:52.50,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:55.13,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}给我等等—!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.13,0:21:57.82,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}这样可不行不行不行不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.82,0:21:59.68,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}要被带偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:02.68,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忙活的可是我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:05.27,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}侵·略·世·界!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.27,0:22:08.31,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}本来不是该是这样的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.31,0:22:09.80,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不行不行不行不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:11.62,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不能被带偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:14.69,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}接连不断的ToDo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.69,0:22:17.11,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大·眼·睛 泪水汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.11,0:22:20.11,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}要微笑微笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.74,0:22:23.38,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}笑! 微笑微笑!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.17,0:22:36.67,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:38.92,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}你好哇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.13,0:22:43.01,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}放轻松哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.76,0:22:52.27,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}我来治愈你平日积累的劳累
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.81,0:23:01.32,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}如果治愈了平日积累的劳累
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.95,0:23:10.45,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}又可以快乐玩耍啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.12,0:23:15.38,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}锤锤锤 锤锤锤
